{"ticker":"DE","updated":"2026-10-23T22:51:13Z","profile":{"longName":"Deere & Company","shortName":"Deere & Company","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Farm & Heavy Construction Machinery","country":"United States","website":"https://www.deere.com","fullTimeEmployees":73100,"marketCap":174218461184,"trailingPE":35.91718,"forwardPE":28.367023,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.6350796,"pegRatio":1.49,"targetMeanPrice":694.0078,"targetHighPrice":813.18,"targetLowPrice":500.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.049,"earningsGrowth":0.074,"grossMargins":0.25184,"operatingMargins":0.13372,"profitMargins":0.10168,"totalRevenue":47927001088,"beta":0.872,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":721.22,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":454.5,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.01},"summary":"Deere & Company engages in the manufacture and distribution of various equipment worldwide. The company operates through four segments: Production and Precision Agriculture, Small Agriculture and Turf, Construction and Forestry, and Financial Services. The Production and Precision Agriculture segment provides four-wheel-drive track and row crop tractors, harvesters, cotton pickers and strippers, sugarcane harvesters and loaders, soil preparation, tillage, seeding, and crop care equipment, as well as application equipment, including sprayers and nutrient management, soil preparation machinery, and related attachments and service parts. The Small Agriculture and Turf segment offers specialty, utility, and compact tractors; self-propelled forage harvesters and attachments; rotary mowers, hay and forage equipment, and utility vehicles; turf and utility equipment, including riding lawn, commercial mowing, and golf course equipment, and utility vehicles, as well as implements for mowing, tilling, snow and debris handling, aerating, residential, commercial, golf, and sports turf care applications. The Construction and Forestry segment provides backhoe loaders, crawler dozers and loaders, four-wheel-drive loaders, excavators, motor graders, articulated dump trucks, skid-steer loaders, milling machines, recyclers, slipform and asphalt pavers, surface miners, compactors, tandem, static r","summary_zh":"迪爾公司在全球從事各種設備的製造和分銷。該公司透過四個部門運作：生產和精準農業、小型農業和草坪、建築和林業以及金融服務。生產和精準農業部門提供四輪驅動履帶式和中耕作物拖拉機、收割機、棉花採摘機和剝離機、甘蔗收割機和裝載機、整地、耕作、播種和作物護理設備，以及應用設備，包括噴霧器和養分管理、整地機械以及相關附件和服務部件。小型農業和草坪部門提供專業、實用和緊湊型拖拉機；自走式青貯收割機及附件；旋轉割草機、乾草和飼料設備以及多用途車輛；草坪和公用設施設備，包括騎行草坪、商業割草和高爾夫球場設備以及多用途車輛，以及用於割草、耕作、雪和碎片處理、通氣、住宅、商業割草和高爾夫球場設備以及多用途車輛，以及用於割草、耕作、雪和碎片處理、通氣、住宅、商業割草和高爾夫球運動草坪護理應用的工具。建築和林業部門提供反鏟裝載機、履帶式推土機和裝載機、四輪驅動裝載機、挖土機、平地機、鉸接式自卸卡車、滑移裝載機、銑刨機、回收機、滑模和瀝青攤舖機、露天採礦機、壓實機、串聯式、靜態挖土機","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"農業和重型工程機械","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":496.25,"h":496.36,"l":487.66,"c":487.9,"v":729600},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":488.01,"h":490.38,"l":480.01,"c":487.76,"v":1502800},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":486.1,"h":493.66,"l":485.46,"c":493.08,"v":912400},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":495.0,"h":495.0,"l":489.61,"c":491.44,"v":1120400},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":484.82,"h":487.79,"l":474.62,"c":478.64,"v":1535100},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":472.92,"h":481.89,"l":470.85,"c":476.78,"v":1600700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":475.21,"h":477.84,"l":466.76,"c":469.52,"v":1515400},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":470.08,"h":474.9,"l":466.96,"c":474.9,"v":1486800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":475.34,"h":478.39,"l":470.24,"c":473.26,"v":1262400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":473.87,"h":481.74,"l":471.05,"c":481.51,"v":1271500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":479.92,"h":483.38,"l":469.8,"c":475.6,"v":1204300},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":473.66,"h":479.49,"l":471.22,"c":471.35,"v":1347400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":471.5,"h":478.62,"l":471.09,"c":476.46,"v":1368700},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":473.96,"h":474.37,"l":469.3,"c":470.51,"v":1764500},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":472.26,"h":473.05,"l":462.83,"c":469.11,"v":1787700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":471.98,"h":475.5,"l":466.88,"c":468.7,"v":1659200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":471.58,"h":475.25,"l":464.33,"c":469.12,"v":1522500},{"t"